. The scenario takes place in an old apartment building that is currently being connected to the fiber network.\n\nConnecting a Subscriber in Two Activities : \n\n- Installation, connection and fiber splicing in the building riser\n- Optical testing of the connection\n", "short_description": "Optical Fiber Installation in an Existing Building\n\nYou are an optical fiber technician. Your task is to connect the optical fiber so that the customer can access very high-speed broadband. The scenario takes place in an old apartment building that is currently being connected to the fiber network.\n\nConnecting a Subscriber in Two Activities : \n\n- Installation, connection and fiber splicing in the building riser\n- Optical testing of the connection\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Vignette-FG.png", "id": "4520263918238677", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON_FOREGROUND_512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_4520263921572010_4231555810188739929_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pGIDyMwY05cQ7kNvwFjTVJU&_nc_oc=AdojLmbBI4RVXQ6bkR1j-8aXy14hy0MpRC4zkk5XxpHY4vGfqVNhEDy7zYLH63PTxR8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXgCw10pqvJ3OcMjzvWp1TbDQfWodaiyjQ_HSwF4DT4qQ&oe=6B0F0AFC"}, {"file_name": "Paysage.png", "id": "3048432118822031", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827585_3048432122155364_2255343173292150883_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fv_PlPQERCAQ7kNvwGnp4rn&_nc_oc=Adrsdvmx5ObdSQpPalSiL2bFQgKXSYpI_a-jAmEMNtPM1BQqEcm_rCK93dwan8wCzWs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVFqptsuU6MByEB3f6Kjd4EROn-gs318APQoApfqLEkXA&oe=6B0F18EA"}, {"file_name": "layered_icon_composited.png", "id": "2381195219384732", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LAYERED_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308578_2381195222718065_216484931